    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez (@AOC)\n\nI never have. Feel free to continue lying publicly, though. Those checks don\u2019t cash themselves and you aren\u2019t talented enough to be relevant with the truth.\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/AOC/status/2038310906845614535#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2038343042625597777",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-29T19:50:26+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
