    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Spencer Pratt is actually a really impressive change candidate. He's landing brutal blows and his messaging is easy to digest. I've been watching skilled politicians my whole life - don't underestimate his capacity to pull this off and become Mayor.\n\n\nE X X \u27a0A L E R T S (@ExxAlerts)\n\nALERT: LA mayoral candidate Spencer Pratt fires back against Los Angeles Mayor Karen Bass after a reporter asked him if being a \u201creality TV star\u201d is hurtful for his campaign.\n\n\u201cThat was from 20 years ago. If we look",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2037969554907758841",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-28T19:06:20+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
